      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I noticed a similar issue a few days ago, before the update. I was muting my mic and opening my menu while talking to people on stream and my mic kept unmuting itself. I checked my mic settings in the menu and it had changed to default off. I reset it to default on and it started randomly muting my mike. It was only for those few minutes and hasn't happened since.",
