  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-04-12T21:01:35.226Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'm on version 2019.2.1p1 (build number 747), the newest update that was released today. Whenever I switch worlds, the game mutes/ unmutes me depending on when I was muted before or not. This can be easily replicated by just switching worlds.\n\nI'm playing on the Oculus Rift and am playing on the Oculus Store version of the game.",
